Copperline is an independent clean-room pricing workbench. The provisional name
is not a claim of affiliation with Pricefx, ArtCraft, GridCraft or any industrial company.

Architecture and operating-process inspiration: GridCraft by storytold,
https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft (MIT OR Apache-2.0).
Read-only reference checkout inspected at commit
408bb2c3cf14e11fe4e73ebb140d683fe27f06c1.
No GridCraft source code or visual assets were copied. Its engine-first layering,
command boundary, never-crash policy, and quality-gate approach informed this project.
Public Pricefx documentation informed capability terminology, not implementation.
All fixture companies, products, prices and identities are synthetic.

Third-party Rust dependencies retain their own licenses. See
legal/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt and docs/dependency-license-inventory.tsv.
Exact notice provenance and documented upstream limitations appear in
legal/README.md and legal/notice-coverage.json; completeness/legal clearance
is not asserted.
